      },
      "body": {
        "en": "*Myśleć* (to think), *marzyć* (to dream), *rozmawiać* (to talk), *dyskutować* (to discuss) and *pamiętać* (to remember) take *o* (about) and the locative: *marzę o wakacjach*, *rozmawiamy o pracy*, *myślę o tobie*. To ask: *o czym?* (about what?) and *o kim?* (about whom?). *Pamiętam o urodzinach* is I have not forgotten the birthday."
